id=ternak_tt
name=Ternak TT — Zygisk Fresh Persona
version=v1.1.8
versionCode=1108
author=Ilham311
description=Zygisk device spoofer targeting TikTok (musically/trill/lite) + Grab Passenger. 6-layer Java hook + 78 native prop spoofs + L7 TYPED spoof tables + companion fork+setns bind mount overlay. v1.0.15: target list moved out of the binary into /data/adb/modules/ternak_tt/target.txt — hot-reloaded by companion (mtime watch). v1.1.6: Path B AAR-based (lsplant .so from Maven Central shipped via /system/lib{,64}/ overlay). v1.1.7: swapped Dobby -> ShadowHook (bytedance/android-inline-hook v1.0.9) because Dobby master broke on NDK r26d; SONAME renamed to libternak_shadowhook.so to avoid TikTok collision; javac -bootclasspath android.jar via platforms;android-34. v1.1.8: fix v1.1.7 CI (exit 1) — (1) jni/CMakeLists.txt bumped to cmake_minimum_required 3.22.1 and LANGUAGES C CXX (added C — CMake 3.31.6 was failing with `No known features for C compiler` because CMAKE_C_COMPILER was unset when ShadowHook subdir tried to build C sources); (2) build.sh Path-B guard now checks jni/shadowhook/ instead of the removed jni/dobby/ (was silently disabling Path B); (3) added -DCMAKE_POLICY_VERSION_MINIMUM=3.5 to suppress NDK-toolchain deprecation cascade. Works on Zygisk-Next / HMA-OSS, KernelSU + LSPosed, Android 12-16.
updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Ilham311/Tt/main/update.json
